 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Classical theorems of Fröhlich and Spencer, formalized in Lean 4",
  "excerpt": "A **Lean 4 / Mathlib** formalization of three papers of J. Fröhlich and T. Spencer on phase transitions in lattice systems with an abelian symmetry and on localization: the Kosterlitz–Thouless transition (1981), massless phases of lattice gauge theories and spin systems (1982), and the absence of diffusion in the Anderson model (1983). The two-dimensional multiscale analysis follows the finite-volume presentation of Kharash and Peled."
 },
